    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. basically the management risk is the big one. what about the operational side though? like, when things go wrong with the actual execution of trades or the fund's internal tracking, how common is it for there to be some kind of unexpected glitch or error that messes with the returns?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
